# Prefix: Mods.SkillBar (from filename)

Keybinds: {
	SkillSlot1.DisplayName: Skill Bar Slot 1
	SkillSlot2.DisplayName: Skill Bar Slot 2
	SkillSlot3.DisplayName: Skill Bar Slot 3
	SkillSlot4.DisplayName: Skill Bar Slot 4
	SkillSlot5.DisplayName: Skill Bar Slot 5
	SkillSlot6.DisplayName: Skill Bar Slot 6
	SkillSlot7.DisplayName: Skill Bar Slot 7
	SkillSlot8.DisplayName: Skill Bar Slot 8
	SkillSlot9.DisplayName: Skill Bar Slot 9
	SkillSlot10.DisplayName: Skill Bar Slot 10
}

DragHint: Drag to move skill bar
NotUsable: That item cannot be placed on the skill bar.
BlockedItem: Yoyos and flails cannot be used from the skill bar. Use your hotbar for those weapons.
NoResources: Not enough mana or materials to use that skill.
Assigned: Assigned {0} to skill bar.
ShiftAssignHint: Shift+click inventory items to assign them to the skill bar. Shift+click a filled slot to copy it to the next empty slot.
EmptySlot: That skill bar slot is empty.
NeedInInventory: You need that item in your inventory to use it from the skill bar.
SlotCleared: No {0} left in inventory — removed from skill bar.
NoMana: Not enough mana.
CannotUse: Cannot use that item right now.
UseFailed: Could not use that skill. Aim at the world and make sure you have mana or ammo.
OnCooldown: That skill is still on cooldown.
CannotPlace: Cannot place there. Aim at a valid spot within reach.
OutOfRange: That location is out of placement range.
NothingToMine: Nothing to mine or chop there. Aim at a block, tree, or wall.
KeybindHelp: Skill Bar - press Z for slot 1, or set keys in Mod Config. Middle-click a slot to use. Hold the key for channel weapons (flamethrower, etc.).
InputReady: Skill Bar input active. Slot 1 key is {0}. Enable debug in config to log presses.
SlotPressed: "[Skill Bar] Slot {0} ({1}) via {2}"
UseOk: "[Skill Bar] Mining tile ({0}, {1})"
UseDebugFail: "[Skill Bar] Use failed ({0})"
UseCrashed: "[Skill Bar] Error: {0}"
